1 _META <metadataxml><content><line>&lt;p&gt;Mary Dudich Mihalak&lt;br&gt;Rocky River, Ohio&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Mary Dudich Mihalak, 82, of Rocky River, Ohio, died Tuesday, Oct. 15, 2002.&lt;br&gt;She was born July 24, 1920, in Saltsburg.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt
2 CONC ;Mrs. Mihalak was preceded in death by her husband, Frank J. and children Joseph, Frances Marie and Harry Stephen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Surviving are her daughter, Katherine Juhasz and husband, Stephen;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Also granddaughter Mary-Fran
2 CONC ces Ju-hasz; daughter-in-law Susan; brothers, John Dudich and wife Dorothy and Paul Dudich and wife Mary Jane; a sister, Mrs. Al (Irene) Mackiewicz; nieces, nephews, great-nieces, great-nephews and cousins.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A funeral Mass was cel
2 CONC ebrated Friday at La Verna Chapel of Mt. Alverna Home, in Parma, Ohio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A graveside service was held Saturday at St. Matthew Cemetery, Saltsburg.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Obituary from The Blairsville Dispatch, Blairsville, Pa.)&lt;/p&
2 CONC gt;</line></content></metadataxml>
